{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_title", "source_sha256": "b47ae52dfd37844ff856e7f983e1cf7c2e1ea4cc7a3eaf0e3971a68db3d48eed", "ja": "きっと、どこまでも！", "zh": "一定能展翅高飞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_synopsis", "source_sha256": "af99959ceaccb83f0b8b392a7b427a1a97f85d1250a55914eed172c103928509", "ja": "次回のセンターに決まった麗花に翻弄される\n助っ人の瑞希、茜、紬。紬は自分の未熟さか\nら助っ人を辞退するが、そんな紬と一緒だか\nら自分は自由にできると気持ち伝えた麗花は\n公演で歌声を翼に、空へ羽ばたくのだった。", "zh": "预定担任下次公演Center的丽花，\n将帮手瑞希、茜、䌷搞得天旋地转。\n䌷认为自己不够成熟而想推辞帮手，\n但丽花表示就是因为有䌷，她才能自由自在，\n并在公演上将歌声化为羽翼，展翅飞向天空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb980047f7666de5938336e9027afb1539b813acec43861bca989efa93243dd1", "ja": "（さあ、いよいよレッスン開始だ。\n麗花らしいパフォーマンスを期待しよう！）", "zh": "（好，训练课程终于要开始了。\n期待丽花能拿出特色十足的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "77c9e7c0dde7f6ccc4d307ce8e9d402dca78a90cda3d2d41faaaab84806660a9", "ja": "いらっしゃーい！　スポドリ冷えてるよ♪\nみんな、じゃんじゃか持ってってね！", "zh": "欢迎光临──！有清凉的运动饮料喔♪\n大家尽管拿去喝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "8b14149f738dea6a91bc1440d4b55fa3cadb5e79203ab9ce0d5fe65e04faed50", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんも1本どうぞ！\nスポドリデューサーさんですね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生也来一瓶吧！\n这样就是运动饮料制作人了！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1003_p", "source_sha256": "39eac5b59d8295732c0976d56e73eab0794c553dfb21666ad61344f917d2a7f5", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……\nというか、これからレッスンでいいんだよな？", "zh": "好，谢谢……\n话说，你们是现在要开始练习对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "f7e41c53c477b529123bbf0cb02c8bb93e70f414f929412836f1fe95d594c591", "ja": "そうですよ！　レッスンの前にも後にも、\nたっぷり水分補給しちゃってくださいね♪", "zh": "对啊！\n练习前后都要好好补充水分喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d6aa85754d8530528c34ad7b44366649aee0d09dce8cd0b03a6de3bfc5524589", "ja": "なるほど……。よし、しっかり水分補給して、\n3人とも麗花のサポート、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "原来是这样……好，那好好补充水分后，\n就麻烦你们三位尽力协助丽花啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cccb6e82de61d46b47df2049d34126da325138fab3de70a3684ac704c5c60f30", "ja": "3人……。\nでは、やっぱりうちも……。", "zh": "三位……\n所以，果然把人家也算进去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "15f851431981d88894c46e9e7667681c9c7a5430a089ceabf74d2ac11f46d846", "ja": "北上さんはライバルですが、同時に大切な仲間です。\n強力助っ人の私におまかせください。キリッ。", "zh": "北上虽然是我的劲敌，但同时也是重要的伙伴。\n请交给我这个强力帮手吧。（正色）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "6da18a847ea39b81d83d243fe2d7323a413a8f5b6b8596d1f9e1202f29e27ef7", "ja": "そうそう！　茜ちゃんという最強の助っ人が\nいるんだから、公演は大成功間違いなしだよ！", "zh": "没错没错！有最强帮手小茜在场，\n公演肯定会大成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "580d7718997ed764466bd2c571b9e1b196f6ccff2e228e949d3e952605ee36d3", "ja": "助っ人……。\nあの、{$P$}っ？", "zh": "帮手……\n不好意思，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1010_p", "source_sha256": "41d1c745123e4e71796214669651c877071dc93cdc21217b073ed77e5b3f6385", "ja": "うん？　どうしたんだ、紬？", "zh": "嗯？䌷，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a984f9c436382b429ea6e391fd61d4f09043a478202c2ad91c7df8fedae219d", "ja": "どうしたもこうしたもありません。\nもう少し、落ち着いて考えてください。", "zh": "你居然还敢问。\n请你冷静思考看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d1f660c46bc13f85bb09f73b7e2d2e7fec75d3183c8b447f06669bf1825e1f4", "ja": "北上さんは歌もダンスも、本当にお上手です。\nですから、その……。", "zh": "北上的歌唱与舞蹈真的都非常出色。\n所以，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ab93dc8bcae91ee2266e77864a02ba41e75569c4d316e0c3dab0a688870055b", "ja": "私が一緒に出ても、お役に立てないどころか、\n足を引っ張ってしまうだけではありませんか？", "zh": "我要是同台演出，别说是协助了，\n甚至可能只会扯后腿，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "11cf50edb29b229024c1bcdca381c04504a51fc97ed56db3f44300a3c5b72f6d", "ja": "大丈夫！\n心配ないよ、紬ちゃん♪", "zh": "没问题！\n放心吧，小䌷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc5ab79e293a99d947106da8e509ad4aa88f4f28a7d8716f447b862d5c7f7a20", "ja": "北上さん……。", "zh": "北上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "4635f80e7f62a83e22df2332664d3b14b6a556a8fb5059906d061d313ef127d5", "ja": "私、登山が趣味だから足腰にはすごく自信があるんだ！\nだから引っ張られても、簡単には転ばないよ？", "zh": "我的兴趣是登山，对下盘很有自信喔！\n所以就算你扯我后腿，我也没那么容易摔倒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "15408d1e52ee5f97384ba1fbc00db29a5d1b766d8d8dd255ec76c6343323b71d", "ja": "い、いえ、本当には引っ張らないと思います。\n思いますが、でも……。", "zh": "不、不是，我的意思不是真的要扯你的腿。\n说是这么说，但……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "57cf059f1a0306804582e02ae50b068b13bc2ca967d0d07456b919689b54a1c6", "ja": "白石さん。\n今から怖気づく必要はありません。", "zh": "白石，\n你不用一开始就感到害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5c1fb72bb1b4d114b2123ec104c14f73d502a81a2067d0f3e1aa88e21f4f755d", "ja": "真壁さん……けど。", "zh": "真壁……可是──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "4be6d18d08b0e3682bf8f41ae248ffacaba41a471fe912e150f82bc48bae9874", "ja": "{$P$}の言うとおり、\n白石さんも、我々強力助っ人のひとりです。", "zh": "{$P$}说得没错，\n白石也是我们强力帮手的一员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "8bb5bad3afbc8bc8d81c4bde5a60d9866798cf2bc45767d6926a61bc63cc7654", "ja": "そうそう！　なんといっても茜ちゃんたちは、\n麗花ちゃんより先にセンターに立ってる先輩だからね♪", "zh": "没错没错！再怎么说，\n小茜我们都是比小丽花还早担任Center的前辈嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6e1224e3a3f3bee41c10de27b3a65627bd69224a87995336a7078086fa3f3fad", "ja": "先に、センターに……？\nあっ。では、この助っ人の人選は、そういう……？", "zh": "先担任、Center……？\n啊！这么说，在场这些帮手的人选，就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "6c4c34deab5faa06db720ea6585a3702b5bb56e12944a2fdaa618237d8512c0b", "ja": "北上さんの魅力は、自由さです。その持ち味を活かす\nために、脇をセンター経験者でしっかりと固める。", "zh": "自由率性就是北上的魅力。为了能发挥她的特色，\n于是在她身旁部署担任过Center的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "a5eb28a82a77ac3b04f01dd923c652c38d663a900f2f4b34eb89e970222314eb", "ja": "それが今回の作戦だと、私は推測しました。\n合っていますか、{$P$}。", "zh": "我推测这就是本次的战略。\n{$P$}，我说对了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a76091a3161225bc2485b342d801953c90865b021ed622bc97264e0f3ef1dcb9", "ja": "ああ、その通りだ。ステージの上では、センター\n経験者だからこそわかる事が、たくさんあると思う。", "zh": "没错，你说对了。\n我想应该只有当过Center，才能理解许多表演中的细节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c6d3976a667a9f4e844df54c9e050c994b9a700ded8dbab4f8b6921d08de86c3", "ja": "みんなには、経験者の立場から\n麗花をフォローしてやって欲しいんだ。", "zh": "我希望大家站在过来人的立场，\n好好支援丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c2e41f9ecbd074b1a5c0863efbd15e3a11332f1edc2fb780012fb321ab74f607", "ja": "経験者……。わかりました。\nでしたら確かに、多少なりとも分かることもあります。", "zh": "过来人……我明白了。\n这么说来，我的确多少有较深的体悟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6adb399f0e24ed2c60224d0e56b9fb5442c57b56b24043527021402119d1dda7", "ja": "それならそうと、もっと早く言ってください。\nそしたら、お騒がせしなくて済んだものを……。", "zh": "你应该要早点讲清楚的。\n早点说，就不会闹这么大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0a5fdefb7f39c612a1ad518cb75ef2b7ee603544f984b39afae29c525d2fe5e0", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\nまあ、そういうわけだから、任せたぞ、みんな！", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n总之，事情就是这样，麻烦你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "bb08156eb47fbbcde4a5c67ccf2f50b70329ff16f33bb747114f7d422021ce13", "ja": "は～いっ☆", "zh": "好的～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "88eba0466fbb28cc3c15cca271539db6f859495fa70c0aa4eba8793219231af0", "ja": "そっか～、そういうことだったんですね。\nふふっ、頼もしいな！　頼もしトリオですね♪", "zh": "这样啊～原来是这么一回事。\n呵呵，真可靠！你们是可靠三人组喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "0ef1358d7e4d429d3e00685ba0b33af3dcb920a49ac4650429999c7d2fbd7c16", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、私はできるだけ自由に、\n歌ったり踊ったり休んだりしますね！　ラララ～♪", "zh": "那么那么，我就尽量自由地\n唱歌、跳舞、休息啰！啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "70b5a6d638dd92c88de34b84aca4fcbed7b85d6e4008fa40438d8794e62f8c52", "ja": "ちょっと待ったー！　麗花ちゃん、自由に\n歌う前に、することがあるんじゃないかニャ？", "zh": "等一下──！小丽花，\n在你自由唱歌之前，不是应该有件该办的事情喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "fd16edc8f460859aeab31ae25c030e2bde6b751e888a7e3418e39207a1c09292", "ja": "すること……？\nあっ、わかった！　自己紹介だね！", "zh": "该办的事情……？\n啊！我知道了！自我介绍对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "ae6d354d287afe983f06b687d82737634861019a5336fe2da0251a0bfcd7010c", "ja": "私、北上麗花っていいます♪\n20歳の牡牛座で、最近のマイブームは～♪", "zh": "我叫做北上丽花♪\n20岁，金牛座，最近热衷的事情是～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "80daac4c41e410d8a26cfabc21cc620b2868f2a02376fc045474a5170443c11c", "ja": "おおーっと！　そこから始めちゃうとは、\nさすがの茜ちゃんもビックリかなー！", "zh": "再等一下──！居然从自我介绍开始，\n连小茜都大吃一惊啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec97cb8d66b26d6ce4b96a28fa7d0481555c04d8dc18e85bbf04086026251524", "ja": "そうだ！　本番のライブでも、\n自己紹介を取り入れるっていうのはどうかな？", "zh": "对了！正式演唱会时，\n也加入自我介绍如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "3e2e2c891824958af92171ae4f33e88a872f235a083e3c67dff97152716b8f89", "ja": "……自己紹介なら、普段の公演でもしてるよね？", "zh": "……平时的公演本来就会做自我介绍了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "c528c596a68c9c90288c21bb1b8ec69d0d090fd84b18f9a333b293b9e0aa1bb0", "ja": "ううん。私たちじゃなくて、\nお客さんに自己紹介してもらうの♪", "zh": "不对。我不是说我们的自我介绍，\n我想请观众自我介绍♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "1631667bc7ad995beb4c70ced1aaf2defc9203022bbd6e802fcaf63756391375", "ja": "お客さんかー。人数が多すぎて、\n公演時間内に終わらないんじゃないかなー？", "zh": "原来是观众啊──这样人数太多了，\n公演的时间应该不够吧──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "85bab740334a24d5c8c7ba89b684cdfa221fc5ce15a1d5ff2da8fd24c543c5d5", "ja": "電車がなくなって、\n帰れなくなっちゃう人が出てくるかもよ？", "zh": "拖太晚就没有电车搭，\n可能会有人回不了家喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "aab6ca4867ab8a63cd90180a2fc5b670348d5adac47f717be02c975813820cdb", "ja": "そっか、残念……。あっ、じゃあお客さんのために、\n劇場の前にテント村を作っちゃうのはどうかな？", "zh": "这样啊，真可惜……啊！\n那就帮观众在剧场前面搭建帐篷区，如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1045_p", "source_sha256": "bad2df3d6a2cea621737d95fcf3f2ce8180d139d1277cd2fedd3db3b24293896", "ja": "（おお、さっそく自由な展開に……！）", "zh": "（喔喔，马上就自由起来了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5a10f2e204d65d8167cb998d8a7d950472232388fd2d09e158ebd178fa9a30a", "ja": "この流れは、想定していませんでした。\nさすがは北上さんです。……負けられないぞ。", "zh": "我没想到会发展成这样。\n不愧是北上……但我不会输的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "6283ce3ad541a2a5e62e2760ceb3f3e9da00b6f4e016d0afd18fc9ef66064e68", "ja": "北上さん。劇場の前にテント村を作るのは、\nいかがなものかと思います。", "zh": "北上，我认为在剧场前搭建帐篷区，\n并不是个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1048_023aka", "source_sha256": "29028b3762c6ab70b0e4767e30015a9a5eaa30ba67847c12cec765fe50614502", "ja": "おお！　ツッコミが追いつかない茜ちゃんに、\n強力な助っ人が！", "zh": "喔喔！小茜吐槽快吐不完的时候，\n出现强力帮手了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1049_044miz", "source_sha256": "82c030fd748aae023f61103423c634418494e8b8b55436820dc1ffc4a0948bf2", "ja": "数日かかるのであれば、仮設住宅を設置しましょう。\nもちろん、お風呂とトイレ完備です。", "zh": "因为会耗时数天，我认为应该搭建临时组合屋。\n当然，里头卫浴设备一应俱全。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "eeacb1a18020bbab6b716aebf3166f78be1273196cf847cd4ee88fce544636e4", "ja": "と思ったらボケ側だったー！　ボケとツッコミの\nバランス悪すぎない？　茜ちゃんピンチじゃない！？", "zh": "不对，她也是来装傻的──！\n吐槽和装傻之间也太不平衡！小茜是不是陷入危机了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5a850e5049da9664009e6e5a74b76d4c9eb8b29a617fe3ff2f2dbb265d022c06", "ja": "（思った以上に自由だが……頼むぞ、茜！）", "zh": "（她们自由到超乎想像……拜托你了，茜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1052_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d7aee5b76a5df23bd225988f762c00b8dc74ae163472c853b451c8be6f15c8f0", "ja": "あの。\n……あの、{$P$}！", "zh": "不好意思。\n……不好意思，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1053_p", "source_sha256": "f5f682e1247ae926c5b119ae75f823f0e5f4ff40cf7c47a241fdda3f5286804b", "ja": "……ん？　紬、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "……嗯？䌷，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1054_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cb2f2f9c9a99794f0878336940455430da819b8267f33541358b33335c56f9e7", "ja": "どうかしたのか、ではありません。\nそんな悠長に構えて、貴方は不安ではないのですか。", "zh": "你居然还这么问。\n态度这么悠哉，难道你都不会担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1055_p", "source_sha256": "c3adb333ad52b8e3bd46ad27497bc35d080fba76358c52620f8bb9d8eb07cc59", "ja": "不安？", "zh": "担心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1056_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc5f2abb5e8c73a61cc5097a1cf1ad3937e68144c74afa8ecb08f93658758995", "ja": "わかりませんか。先ほどから私だけ、\nみなさんの会話についていけていません。", "zh": "你看不出来吗？\n我从刚才就一直跟不上大家的对话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1057_p", "source_sha256": "b6a38c5a05b003466561006f10e6f0474bb37888027f72060d65375c269fd808", "ja": "ま、まあ、そうだろうな。\nでも紬は、無理についていかなくても……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，也是啦。\n不过，䌷，其实你也不用勉强跟上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1058_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4bd02831ea0c4799baab6eac2684c7bab16e562b34d8cc98fe63732b8bf7415a", "ja": "これでは、本番でも……みなさんの自由の、\n足かせになってしまいかねません。", "zh": "可是这么一来，正式演出时……\n我或许会成为大家自由的枷锁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1059_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a0b9b804467f6b78f6b39b1675b7b557ff06582f41e4029aed6e90906301b01a", "ja": "ましてや、北上さんのセンター公演の\n助っ人だなんて……私にはやはり、荷が重いです。", "zh": "更别提我还要担任北上Center公演的帮手……\n这对我来说，实在太过沉重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1060_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4ddec23ed96f384ccb0a3023dad33b94db18617707411485d2c9b3927573fb0c", "ja": "センター経験者は、他にもいます。\nですから……。", "zh": "况且还有其他人也担任过Center，\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1061_048rei", "source_sha256": "c9f805450202616e5014c4a9440756524bc22033524ead5d107da71932348b84", "ja": "えーっ？\nでも私は、紬ちゃんと一緒がいいな！", "zh": "咦──？\n可是我想要和小䌷一起表演耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1062_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a74e04f748e0da00c1e6527d690ec3ffe03d91f7f2339eaf78db755b7ab4066", "ja": "私と……。北上さん、どうして……。\nもしかして、まだパンダユニットに未練が？", "zh": "和我一起……北上，这是为什么……\n该不会，你还对熊猫团体念念不忘吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1063_048rei", "source_sha256": "7c49cfa23fecbf0fb811162fda744050afe8525c1ae10445cfe7ca7e0b52a9f1", "ja": "ううん、そうじゃないよ。", "zh": "没有啊，不是那样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1064_048rei", "source_sha256": "adff9cc19638bae7a0bf8bbe9d48849fd380888d419015715c078cbf71cbc935", "ja": "紬ちゃんが、とっても真面目で頑張り屋さんで、\nとーっても一生懸命だからだよ！", "zh": "小䌷，你认真又努力，\n而且总是全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1065_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1066_048rei", "source_sha256": "d3f21f34e7022bf7d78f05ad9333ccc7777a24834896a670311f72151122a73a", "ja": "私、紬ちゃんと一緒なら、思いっきり\n空に飛び出せるんじゃないかな？って思うんだ♪", "zh": "我觉得要是和小䌷一起表演，\n或许就可以尽情飞上天空了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1067_044miz", "source_sha256": "dc2d0ad2babc925d2640b983900275cfe395823cd5a7aa3e1902013f7ac13a47", "ja": "空に飛び出せる……。\n白石さんのおかげで、地に足がつくというわけですね。", "zh": "飞上天空……\n意思就是说，因为有了白石，所以才踩得到地面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1068_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1069_p", "source_sha256": "c171d8c2e51bbdc947685497df8adc062c2945872fbc3a25232570aa8e073328", "ja": "……足場があってこそ高く飛べるし、\n飛んだ後は着地もできるだろ？", "zh": "……有了立足点才能展翅高飞，\n而飞完后也有地方能着地，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1070_p", "source_sha256": "ced0a0745843a44572b23c15d03e171cf40b5fe35fdb559eeb69d56d9c8e3216", "ja": "3人の話についていけない紬だから、いいんだよ。\n麗花だけじゃなくて、みんなの足場として。", "zh": "䌷，你跟不上她们三个的节奏，这样才好。\n不只是为了丽花，你将成为大家的立足点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1071_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a85a1a34c63e17368554218c639f89673fb94966bb47f9dd48ea2538a3de2b77", "ja": "{$P$}……\nで、ですが、私は。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n可、可是，我──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1072_023aka", "source_sha256": "68e30a80a5f8dd614541309165815d895045f01603040c58d852f44bf3318129", "ja": "つむりん！　茜ちゃんは優秀で可愛くて天才だけど、\nこの状況じゃツッコミが追いつかないんだよね！", "zh": "䌷䌷！小茜虽然是个优秀又可爱的天才，\n但如今四面楚歌，来不及吐槽啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1073_023aka", "source_sha256": "fb3efce287c3647230c6bc621f1db677e727e1e677735bf30a1570fcebcd082e", "ja": "だからつむりんは、茜ちゃんと一緒にツッコミやろう！\nというか、やって！　お願いっ！", "zh": "所以䌷䌷，你来和小茜一起吐槽吧！\n不对，请你来吐槽！求求你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1074_044miz", "source_sha256": "c8cec6fb12b48ba9c1aeea22e64da2d733e45a037059c31cd65cb6ffe5e81a08", "ja": "白石さん。\nこう見えて北上さんは、とても手強いです。", "zh": "白石，\n别看北上这样，她可是很难对付的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1075_048rei", "source_sha256": "a3dc86c4167779911fc05a5adf1d7a33c6e64e72c00e2721447e9731395cb0c7", "ja": "えへへ、ほめられちゃいました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，被夸奖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1076_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8499086df482fb68a84e52389f90c4fbf2a80fa02432e20f283bb88d1ee523a", "ja": "ですがその分、挑みがいがあると思います。\n白石さんの冴えたツッコミ、期待してます。ぐっ。", "zh": "不过也因此很有挑战的价值喔。\n我很期待白石带来精辟的吐槽。（握拳）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1077_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1aa671c610e09a6d2c6126acbf1054fecc521a33472ee9d7b2a4915f590dca0f", "ja": "みなさん……。", "zh": "各位……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1078_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e031c3e4d2829ff4fb77f78f4139a9f7592fdd3f11a3a11c6aa5d17c56c85bde", "ja": "そんなふうに言われたら、\nうち、もう……。", "zh": "听到你们这么说，\n人家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1079_048rei", "source_sha256": "5c9384b030c1f737fb9f5aefb58325448989244b12e1811b4b842895fce9e6d1", "ja": "紬ちゃんは、私と一緒にステージに立つのはイヤ？", "zh": "小䌷，你讨厌和我一起表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1080_051tmg", "source_sha256": "587ba701bb46abaa6632d0e6d383e13c4cabcd0d0cabc0411b854b873747741c", "ja": "そ、そんなことありません！\nイヤではありません、決して。", "zh": "没、没那回事！\n我不可能会讨厌，绝不可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1081_048rei", "source_sha256": "e6585c8311fc513c25cbb4272820983d4286271a1bf397d330912aca3927ef38", "ja": "よかった♪　じゃあ、決まりだね！\n私と一緒に、歌って踊ろう♪　ねっ？", "zh": "太好了♪那就决定啰！\n和我一起唱歌跳舞吧♪好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1082_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ca43fae59b3d1b4db04017eaabef5ea402980fcee4beebaa0ad8302af2632f2", "ja": "はぁ……。\n北上さんは、本当に自由な方なのですね……。", "zh": "唉……\n北上，你真的是位很自由的人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1083_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3ee2c42e00d926b51d244ac801c78ac21769e127d217ef14524955138a27c317", "ja": "わかりました。そこまでおっしゃって\nいただけるのでしたら、私も覚悟を決めます。", "zh": "我明白了，既然你都说到这个份上，\n我也下定决心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1084_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b1a80362fed0a01e3a6056b08b59255526e64d3ce5130b8c86898c08da2eff42", "ja": "頼りないかもしれませんが、みなさん、\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "我可能不太可靠，不过，\n还请你们多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1085_048rei", "source_sha256": "a48102c1178a1690f1c076a999772ea6f49fecaad4fee7fff1cb0271ff3eb107", "ja": "それじゃ、改めて……紬ちゃん、瑞希ちゃん、\n茜ちゃん。私のサポート、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "那么，从头来过……小䌷、小瑞希、小茜。\n麻烦你们协助我啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1086_048rei", "source_sha256": "0c378095bc53c20452f333b589713ff35f971c3ce24f8eb5dc15f2072c77e5d0", "ja": "ここにいるみんなで一緒に、\n清水の舞台からぷかぷか飛んじゃおうね！", "zh": "在场的所有人都要一起\n从清水舞台轻飘飘地飞上天喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1087_p", "source_sha256": "cdd0cef7bc92bee553ef1b5f353781522e212b418f31efa767887012a3ada2c9", "ja": "ははは。清水の舞台から飛び降りるんじゃなくて、\n飛ぶのか。麗花らしい発想だな。", "zh": "哈哈哈，人家都说要有从清水舞台跳下去的决心，\n丽花倒是要用飞的，这的确是你会有的点子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1088_048rei", "source_sha256": "490a8f4d5a73cab5584aacc496242ba7a58cb3a70065288fccdb8dd079e5bbbd", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　……あ、そうだ！\nステージで本当に飛んじゃうのはどうかな？", "zh": "谢谢夸奖♪啊，对了！\n我们要不要真的在舞台上飞起来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1089_044miz", "source_sha256": "f60eba4cee7bb97c274e97d4bddb679a3df405fbaa02bdddc74e9bbc884e9471", "ja": "ステージで飛ぶ……\nみんなで、大きくジャンプするのでしょうか？", "zh": "在舞台上飞……\n大家一起用力跳起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1090_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6e18489d52e706296acdd182652acf6a92e0b471229ed3b0cd418edca897dd7", "ja": "ううん、違うよ。たとえば……茜ちゃんの背中に、\nたっくさん風船をくくりつけて飛ばすとか？", "zh": "不对，不是喔，比方说……在小茜的背上，\n绑上好多的气球让她飞起来之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1091_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a284b5ca2e791786136340da4c5a30b7e5577a43f5aa915041b3737f7f19274", "ja": "うん、いいアイディアだね！\nでもなんで、茜ちゃんなのかな！？", "zh": "嗯，真是好主意！\n不过为什么是绑小茜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1092_048rei", "source_sha256": "90605f35e83489ee48f2716d657dcfe4ecd831d3997a52f55c2a5a44a8d3b3bc", "ja": "なんとなく！\n茜ちゃんならできそうな気がするなーって♪", "zh": "我也不知道！\n只是觉得小茜应该飞得起来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1093_044miz", "source_sha256": "f993bde7e5b4334305060528deb38b6b6b9ef21ebef818a802f8e6f93500d6d6", "ja": "いえ、さすがの野々原さんにも、\n空を飛ぶのは難しいのではないかと……。", "zh": "不，就算是野野原，\n我认为要飞上天还是很困难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1094_051tmg", "source_sha256": "39c57d2ae8144fd228b1b4cf2f153e05bb078d326d7d47c2df4b07bd01cbf758", "ja": "どうするのですか、{$P$}。\nこのままでは野々原さんが飛ばされてしまいます。", "zh": "怎么办呢，{$P$}？\n再这样下去，野野原就要被送上天了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1095_p", "source_sha256": "56a890b5cd3aa842e8350430ae56b866325d790f1668ee00a3618db88ca2bdc2", "ja": "そ、そうだな。\n後でやんわり止めるように伝えるよ。", "zh": "是、是啊。\n我待会再委婉制止丽花吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1096_048rei", "source_sha256": "88a4a97d300de760b77cb17e6be3df0dda3163f57337474c21c409a642d01553", "ja": "ふんふんふん～♪\n風船のデザインどうしようかな～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪\n要用什么样式的气球呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1097_051tmg", "source_sha256": "90fc8ebe7b7f7a8f82f07b110cd5df731215c6f80b124afa7ae4f70c60ca692e", "ja": "……{$P$}、\nやんわりとではなく、しっかりと止めるべきでは？", "zh": "……{$P$}，\n这应该不能委婉，而是该强硬制止吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1098_p", "source_sha256": "676b6a89098eac295b87cb7f45b998bdcaac5310bcfbae86d6e2f2251f94e66c", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nそうしておくよ……。", "zh": "也、也是。\n就这么做吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1099_051tmg", "source_sha256": "52c6557239d3e6a7bfbcf78d696a15cb0d8537b4b57b1642dd639db426176f5e", "ja": "そうしてもらわなければ困ります。\n大体、人が空を飛ぶなんて不可能なのですから。", "zh": "不制止她的话就糟糕了。\n更何况，人类是不可能飞上天空的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1100_p", "source_sha256": "7bed9dfc273b4a75830f9cbae5dd04ef0f4cb5f282c9b892024b4815fe270e38", "ja": "まあ、そうなんだけど。麗花を見てたら、\nなんだか……そうでもない気がしないか？", "zh": "嗯，是这么说没错啦。\n但是一看到丽花，不觉得……她就有可能办到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1101_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1102_048rei", "source_sha256": "28ff2a364a5c8485734a42d931d57ca1a74d46d588c18e3e05c10da7c996da96", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、そう思いますか？\n私、自分でもそう思うんです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也这么想吗？\n我自己也是喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1103_048rei", "source_sha256": "e5ad3cf9be4a5149ab8d28f00e8f2d9b4ccbfe0bde51743485c29ac080d263e1", "ja": "翼がなくても、空を飛べなくても、\nきっと空は飛べるんじゃないかなーって！", "zh": "就算没有翅膀能飞上天，\n也一定能飞上天空的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_029_1104_044miz", "source_sha256": "885e6a4deba6ef3ddab89adf1189faebe1f0caad6da711c3a1822e78c969324c", "ja": "飛べなくても、飛べる……？\nどういう意味でしょう。……クイズ？", "zh": "不能飞也能飞……？\n这究竟是什么意思……猜谜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
